        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.11.4+2KI.11.5+2KI.11.6+2KI.11.7+2KI.11.8+2KI.11.9+2KI.11.10+2KI.11.11+2KI.11.12+2KI.11.13+2KI.11.14+2KI.11.15+2KI.11.16+2KI.11.17+2KI.11.18+2KI.11.19+2KI.11.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 11:4-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka omu mwaka gwa mushanju Yehoyaada akeegumya, yaaragaana endagaano n'abakuru b'engabo igana-igana, Azaria mwene Yerohaamu, Ishimaeli mwene Yehohanani, Azaria mwene Obedi, Maaseya mwene Adaaya na Elishafaati mwene Zikuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaraba omuri Yuda yoona, baateerana Abaleevi, nibabaiha omu ndembo zoona eza Yuda, n'abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkuru b'Abaisraeli, baija Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abateeraine boona baaragaana endagaano n'omugabe bari omu nju ya Ruhanga. Yehoyaada yaabagira ati: Omwana w'omugabe ngugu! K'ategyekye, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire ahari beene Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu oku nikwo muraatwaze. Omuriimwe abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi abarikwihwa aha murimo ahari sabato, ekicweka kimwe kya kashatu kibe eky'ab'okuridna amarembo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kimwe kya kashatu kibe eky'aha nju y'omugabe, na kimwe kya kashatu ekindi kibe eky'aha irembo ry'omusingi; kandi abantu boona baze omu bikaari bye'nju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.23.27+1CH.23.28+1CH.23.29+1CH.23.30+1CH.23.31+1CH.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 23:27-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hatagira ondiijo weena owaataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA, kureka abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi abarikuheereza; bo bataahemu, ahabw'okuba n'abarikwera; kwonka abandi boona bategyereze okuragiira kwa MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaleevi beehinguririze omugabe, buri muntu aine eby'okurwanisa bye omu ngaro; kandi omuntu weena oraataahe omu nju aitwe. Mugume n'omugabe, yaaba naataahamu, nari naashohora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaleevi n'Abayuda boona baakora nk'ebi Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaabaragiira byona. Buri omwe yaareeta abantu be ab'okwihwa aha murimo ahari sabato, n'ab'okwija aha murimo ahari sabato; ahabw'okuba Yehoyaada omunyamurwa tararagiire baabaire bari aha rubu kutaaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaaha abakuru b'engabo amacumu n'engabo mpango n'enkye, ezaabaire ziri ez'omugabe Daudi, nizibiikwa omu nju ya Ruhanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaataho abantu boona kuba abarinzi b'omugabe, buri muntu aine eky'okurwanisa kye omu ngaro, okuruga aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo bw'enju, okuhika aha rw'obwa bumosho, baayehinguririza eitambiro n'enju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 17:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima yaashohoza omwana w'omugabe, yaamujweka ekirunga, yaamuha Eby'okuhamya; baamuranga ku yaaba omugabe, Yehoyaada n'abatabani baamushukaho amajuta, baagira bati: Omugabe nakaramaare!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalia ku yaahuriire orwari rw'abantu nibairuka nibahimbisa omugabe, yaataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA ahu bantu bari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omugabe ayemereire aha rubaju rw'nyomyo ye aha irembo, n'abakuru b'engabo n'abakondere bamwemereire aha rubaju, n'abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi nibashemererwa nibateera amakondere, kandi n'abeeshongozi baine ebintu byabo by'okuteera nibeebembera abarikweshongora. Ahonaaho Atalia yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaagira ati: Okwebumba! Okwebumba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaashohoza abakuru b'engabo abaatairweho kutegyeka eihe, yaabagira ati: Mumurabye omu ngabo, mumushohoze; oraamukurate weena, mumwite na rurara. Ahakuba omunyamurwa akaragiira ati: Mutamwitira omu nju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo baamutaho engaro, baamurabya omu irembo ry'embaraasi aha irembo ry'enju y'omugabe, baamwitirayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yehoyaada yaaragaana endagaano n'abantu boona kandi n'omugabe kuba abantu ba MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.13.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 13:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Okuruga aho abantu boona baaza ahari nyaruju ya Baali, baagisheenya; amatambiro ge n'ebishushani bye baabisheenyagurira kimwe, baitira Mataani omunyamurwa wa Baali omu maisho g'ago matambiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 28:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.23.3+1CH.23.4+1CH.23.5+1CH.23.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 23:3-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.23.26+1CH.23.27+1CH.23.28+1CH.23.29+1CH.23.30+1CH.23.31+1CH.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.25.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Yehoyaada yaataho abantu b'okurinda enju ya MUKAMA kuguma nibareebererwa abanyamurwa Abaleevi, n'abandi Baleevi, abu Daudi yaataireho kuguma nibareeberera enju ya MUKAMA, kuhongyera MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omu biragiro bya Musa, ngu babihongye nibashemererwa nibeeshongora, nk'oku Daudi yaaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarinzi b'amarembo yaabata aha marembo g'enju ya MUKAMA, ngu omuntu weena otashemeire omu muringo gwona arekye kutaahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima yaatwara abakuru b'engabo, n'ab'ekitiinisa, n'abategyeki b'abantu, hamwe n'abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi, baashuumya omugabe nibamwiha omu irembo rya ruguru, baamutaasya omu nju y'omugabe, baamuta aha kitebe ky'obugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi baashemererwa; kandi bwanyima y'okwita Atalia na rurara, orurembo rwatuuza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
